This contains a .config file that we have configured for the BBB board using menu config and a few custom options, e.g. including the command "config" and setting the uboot shell timeout to 10 seconds.

The other files are output from make:
 - an MLO, the MMC load file that contains the U-boot SPL and executes from SRAM
 - and u-boot.img, the bootloader main-stage that is loaded into and executed from DRAM
 
 To remind us:

+----------+    +------------+    +--------------+    +------------+
| ROM code |--->| U-Boot SPL |--->|    U-Boot    |--->|Linux kernel|
+----------+    +------------+    +--------------+    +------------+
 Stored in       File 'MLO' in     File 'u-boot.img'                  
    ROM          FAT 1st boot      in FAT filesys.                    
                 partition.                                           
                 Runs in SRAM      Runs in DRAM
